{
  "about": "The processing recipes of the non-combat skills (Smithing, Cooking, Crafting, Firemaking), read by scripts/build-processing.ts against the OSRS Wiki. A recipe names the product's page; its level, XP, ticks, tools, materials and output come from the page's free {{Recipe}} for that skill, its success chance from the page's {{Skilling success chart}} (cooking) or the recipe's own note (an iron bar's 50%). A station is a wiki-listed furnace or anvil (the page's location table: the map point and the wiki's distance from the bank) or a permanent fire (its ObjectLocLine near a named place, banked at a named bank). A recipe without a facility is made by a bank. A method of trainingMethods.json lists the recipes it trains. Members recipes and stations are added the same way; the engine skips them on a free account.",
